{"id":"274c21b30aac62ac","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-display-map.md","title":"理解投影的同构闭包","display":"df-display-map — 理解投影的同构闭包","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-display-map","aliases":["16-df-display-map","Display map"],"display":"df-display-map — 理解投影的同构闭包","depends_on":["[[16-df-comprehension-category]]","[[16-df-pullback-square]]"],"source":"Lemma 10.4.4 and Corollary 10.4.5, p. 615 (PDF 635)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-display-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-display-map</span><span>Display map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-display-map — 理解投影的同构闭包"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0ba8f021ca287877\" href=\"?note=0ba8f021ca287877\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-category\">16-df-comprehension-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Lemma 10.4.4 and Corollary 10.4.5, p. 615 (PDF 635)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\">\\(\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi X=(\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX)\">\\(\\chi X=(\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\cong_I\\pi_X\">\\(d\\cong_I\\pi_X\\)</span> 表示在切片 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B/I\">\\(\\mathcal B/I\\)</span> 中同构，即存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:\\operatorname{dom}d\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\{X\\}\">\\(a:\\operatorname{dom}d\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\{X\\}\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_Xa=d\">\\(\\pi_Xa=d\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Disp}\">\\(\\mathrm{Disp}\\)</span> 为本原子定义的记号，其结构参数与完整条件在下文给出。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}\">\\(\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a> 的完整拉回泛性质谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}display\\text{-}map}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)\\coloneqq\n\\{d:A\\to I\\mid(\\exists X\\in\\mathcal E_I)\\ d\\cong_I\\pi_X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}display\\text{-}map}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)\\coloneqq\n\\{d:A\\to I\\mid(\\exists X\\in\\mathcal E_I)\\ d\\cong_I\\pi_X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(\\forall A,I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall d\\in\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)\\cap\\mathcal B(A,I))\n(\\forall u\\in\\mathcal B(J,I))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\Bigl[(\\exists P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\exists a\\in\\mathcal B(P,A))(\\exists b\\in\\mathcal B(P,J))\\\n\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(a,b;d,u)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall a\\in\\mathcal B(P,A))(\\forall b\\in\\mathcal B(P,J))\\\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(a,b;d,u)\\Longrightarrow b\\in\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(\\forall A,I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall d\\in\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)\\cap\\mathcal B(A,I))\n(\\forall u\\in\\mathcal B(J,I))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\Bigl[(\\exists P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\exists a\\in\\mathcal B(P,A))(\\exists b\\in\\mathcal B(P,J))\\\n\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(a,b;d,u)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall a\\in\\mathcal B(P,A))(\\forall b\\in\\mathcal B(P,J))\\\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(a,b;d,u)\\Longrightarrow b\\in\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>证明：先取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\cong_I\\pi_X\">\\(d\\cong_I\\pi_X\\)</span>，再将选定笛卡尔提升 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*X\\to X\">\\(u^*X\\to X\\)</span> 的理解方块作为拉回；任意另一个拉回与之唯一同构。</li>\n<li>因而是所有拉回下稳定，不能把仅含字面对象像的集合无条件宣称为拉回闭。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Lemma 10.4.4 and Corollary 10.4.5, p. 615 (PDF 635)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-comprehension-category","status":"resolved","id":"0ba8f021ca287877","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-comprehension-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-pullback-square]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}$ 采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]] 的完整拉回泛性质谓词。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi X=(\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX)","display":false},{"tex":"d\\cong_I\\pi_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B/I","display":false},{"tex":"a:\\operatorname{dom}d\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\{X\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_Xa=d","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Disp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}display\\text{-}map}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)\\coloneqq\n\\{d:A\\to I\\mid(\\exists X\\in\\mathcal E_I)\\ d\\cong_I\\pi_X\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&(\\forall A,I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall d\\in\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)\\cap\\mathcal B(A,I))\n(\\forall u\\in\\mathcal B(J,I))\\\\\n&\\quad\\Bigl[(\\exists P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\exists a\\in\\mathcal B(P,A))(\\exists b\\in\\mathcal B(P,J))\\\n\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(a,b;d,u)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land(\\forall P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall a\\in\\mathcal B(P,A))(\\forall b\\in\\mathcal B(P,J))\\\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(a,b;d,u)\\Longrightarrow b\\in\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"d\\cong_I\\pi_X","display":false},{"tex":"u^*X\\to X","display":false}],"bytes":1921,"backlinks":[{"id":"3ae97efa23f80edf","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D_\\chi=\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)$ 是 [[16-df-display-map]] 的切片同构闭包；对 $d\\in D_\\chi$，$A_d=\\operatorname{dom}d$、$I_d=\\operatorname{cod}d$，$d^*:\\mathcal P_{I_d}\\to\\mathcal P_{A_d}$。"},{"id":"035ab4b3b2445fb6","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D_\\chi=\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)$ 是 [[16-df-display-map]] 的切片同构闭包；对 $d\\in D_\\chi$，$A_d=\\operatorname{dom}d$、$I_d=\\operatorname{cod}d$，$d^*:\\mathcal P_{I_d}\\to\\mathcal P_{A_d}$。"},{"id":"e67b2cc14b2a23ac","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(p,\\chi)$ 为 [[16-df-comprehension-quantification]] 的理解范畴，$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$，$\\chi X=\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX$。$\\mathrm{CompProd}(p,\\chi)$ 包含沿所有理解投影的右伴随及相应 Beck–Chevalley 条件；$\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)$ 是 [[16-df-display-map]] 的切片同构闭包。$d:J\\to I$ 只在该类中取值，$d^*:\\mathcal E_I\\to\\mathcal E_J$ 使用所选重索引。"},{"id":"53dadf7eff1efeea","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D\\subseteq\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B$ 沿任意基箭头的拉回存在且仍在 $D$；例如 [[16-df-display-map]] 的 $D=\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)$。所有对象与箭头在 [[16-df-category]] 的足够大宇宙内编码。"},{"id":"fa153f5cc8052173","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"末式中 $\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)$ 及 $\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)$ 采用 [[16-df-display-map]] 所引用的完整理解结构及理解投影的垂直同构闭包；其基范畴为同一 $\\mathcal B$。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-185","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-display-map|df-display-map — 理解投影的同构闭包]]"},{"id":"75a4c54baaa666ef","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["0ba8f021ca287877","dacf0503b95c88a9"]}